OL,3,ATrump's new White House Press Secretary
OL,4,AKatie Zacharia holds first briefing
OL,5,
OL,6,FDonald Trump's new White House Press
OL,7,FSecretary Katie Zacharia is giving her
OL,8,Ffirst news conference - watch live from
OL,9,F09:30 EDT (14:30 BST)
OL,11,FThe 42-year-old political strategist is
OL,12,Fa frequent fixture on conservative
OL,13,Fchannels, and has been active in
OL,14,FRepublican politics for most of her
OL,15,Fadult life
OL,17,FZacharia begins by saying President
OL,18,FTrump delivered a blockbuster rally in
OL,19,FOhio last night, crediting his America
OL,20,FFirst agenda "and one of my favourites,
OL,21,Fsecure borders"
